aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.WELCOME.title = Plot creator
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.WELCOME.hint = Turn something you built into a town building. Press F or E to begin. Q and E move between steps. R cancels.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CORNER_FIRST.title = First corner
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CORNER_FIRST.hint = Primary-click a block at one corner of your build.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CORNER_SECOND.title = Opposite corner
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CORNER_SECOND.hint = Primary-click the opposite corner to mark the full area.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.ANCHOR.title = Plot sign spot
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.ANCHOR.hint = Primary-click one of the four outside corners of the footprint (one block beyond the bounds on both X and Z). The sign must not be inside the build area.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.KIND.title = Building type
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.KIND.hint = Press F to open the building type picker. Choose a type, close the panel, then E when it fits. For what each type means, open your town journal Guide → Mechanics → Plot creator staff.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.IDENTITY.title = Name and id
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.IDENTITY.hint = Press F to enter the display name, description, and building id. The id updates from the name until you edit the id field yourself. The prefab file uses this id. Press E when done.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.TAGS.title = Building tags
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.TAGS.hint = Press F to edit tags (comma separated). Example: amenity, nature, fun. Finish the line before pressing E.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.PREFAB_SAVE.title = Save shape
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.PREFAB_SAVE.hint = Press F to export everything inside the bounds using your building settings from the previous step, then E for the next step.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.error.needIdentity = Set a display name and building id before exporting the prefab.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.error.selfBuildDays = Self-build days must be greater than zero.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.error.assemblySections = Assembly sections per axis must be a whole number from 1 to 16 (1 disables sectioned assembly).

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.VARIANT.title = Variant of
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.VARIANT.hint = Press F to pick which main building type this variant counts as, then E.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.SUBSTEP.title = Important spots
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.SUBSTEP.hint = Placement blocks are added to your inventory for each substep. Place or click the required blocks and spots inside the footprint. Press Q to go back — extra placement blocks from the step you leave are removed from your inventory.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.MATERIALS.title = Build materials
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.MATERIALS.hint = Press F to open material storage. Add the items players must supply to build this plot, then E. Items are returned to your inventory when you continue.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.MATERIALS.detail = Virtual chest for this building only — not placed in the world.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.title = Building settings
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.hint = Press F to open settings: treasury gold cost, self-build days, prefab empty spaces, plot token lock, and assembly sections. Close the panel, then E when done.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.detail = Gold is paid from the town treasury when the plot is built. Self-build days is how long the plot takes to finish without a building staff. Save empty spaces controls whether air in your footprint is saved to clear blocks when built. Plot token locked requires players to unlock this plot at the plot crafting bench before they can craft tokens. Assembly sections splits the build into an N×N×N grid (1 = off).

aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.selfBuildDays = Self-build days (game days)

aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.saveEmptySpaces = Save empty spaces in prefab
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.saveEmptySpaces.hint = When on, air in your footprint is saved and clears those blocks when the building is assembled. When off, only solid blocks are saved and existing terrain is kept. Editor empty markers always clear blocks.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.touristDestination = Visitors may stop here
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.touristDestination.hint = When on, portal visitors may walk to this building during the day.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.plotTokenLocked = Plot token locked by default
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.plotTokenLocked.hint = When on, players must unlock this plot at the plot crafting bench (using a plot blueprint) before they can craft plot tokens for it.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.assemblySections = Assembly sections per axis (1–16)

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.REVIEW.title = Review
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.REVIEW.hint = Press F to save the building. You will get a plot token to place it in town.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.DONE.title = Done
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.DONE.hint = Your building was saved. Use the plot token from your inventory to place it in a town.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.MANAGEMENT_BLOCK = Click the town records shelf you placed.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.PRODUCTION_STORAGE = Click the production storage you placed.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.TREASURY_BLOCK = Click the treasury block you placed.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.PLANNING_DESK_POI = Click the town planning desk.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.WORK_POI = Click a work spot (bench or desk).
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.SLEEP_POI = Click a bed or rest spot.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.EAT_POI = Click an eating spot.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.FUN_POI = Click a fun spot (bench to sit).
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.SHOP_SPOT = Place shop stalls from your inventory, confirm each setup, then click each stall with the plot creator staff.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.SHOP_POI = Click the shop counter work spot.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.TOURIST_VISIT_POI = Click where visitors should stand in front of the shop.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.TOURIST_PORTAL_BLOCK = Place the portal platform from your inventory, then click it with the plot creator staff.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.INNKEEPER_SPAWN = Click where the innkeeper should stand.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.VISITOR_SPAWN = Click a visitor spawn spot.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.GUILD_MASTER_SPAWN = Click where the guild master should stand.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.substep.ADVENTURER_SPAWN = Click an adventurer spawn spot. Right-click a purple marker to remove it.

